    <briefdescription>
<para>A pass to do RPO deduction and propagation of function attributes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This pass provides a general RPO or &quot;top down&quot; propagation of function attributes. For a few (rare) cases, we can deduce significantly more about function attributes by working in RPO, so this pass provides the complement to the post-order pass above where the majority of deduction is performed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
